{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16075","headline":"送郑权尚书南海 · 王建","name":"送郑权尚书南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七郡双旌贵，人皆不忆廻。\n戍头龙脑铺，关口象牙堆。\n勅设熏鑪出，蛮辞咒节开。\n市喧山贼破，金贱海船来。\n白氎家家织，红蕉处处栽。\n已将身报国，莫起望乡台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}